            "params": [
              {
                "name": "project_external_id",
                "value": "PRJ1",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Project external identifier."
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Add suppliers to a project using supplier contacts.\n\nYou must supply the unique project external identifier (the one you used when created the project).\n\nYou must supply the external identifiers of the supplier contacts too.\n\nFor best performance, we recommend inviting 10 or less supplier contacts in a single request.\n"
